@api = http://localhost:5017

### Health
GET {{api}}/health

### 1. List customers
GET {{api}}/api/customers

### 2. Portfolio for one customer
GET {{api}}/api/customers/C1001

### 3. Index the sample firm policy (do this once)
POST {{api}}/api/documents/sample-policy

### 4. Advisor requests a portfolio review PDF
POST {{api}}/api/customers/C1001/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestedBy": "Alex Carter",
  "advisorNotes": "Client plans to retire in 2030 and asked about reducing tech concentration."
}

### 5. List reviews for a customer (copy an id for step 6)
GET {{api}}/api/customers/C1001/reviews

### 6. Download a review PDF
GET {{api}}/api/reviews/<review-id>/pdf

### 7. Ask the RAG chatbot
POST {{api}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "C1001",
  "question": "Does Maria's portfolio need rebalancing under our policy? Which asset class is off target?"
}

### 8. Question the documents can't answer (should say it can't answer)
POST {{api}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "C1001",
  "question": "What will Apple stock be worth next year?"
}
